  "title": "Gymshark Vengeance Utility Pants - Black",
  "body_html": "<p><b>GO WITH VENGEANCE</b></p><p>Heavy cotton. Physique-maximising fits. Imposing presence. Vengeance. For the few.</p><ul>\n<li>Easy to wear with premium lightweight material\n</li>\n<li>Toggled ankle cuffs so you can wear them cuffed or straight leg</li>\n<li>Casual but curated oversized fit\n</li>\n<li>Get the perfect fit with an internal drawcord waistband\n</li>\n<li>Zipped side pockets to keep your things secure</li>\n</ul><p><br></p><p><b>SIZE &amp; FIT</b></p><ul>\n<li>Oversized fit</li>\n<li>Model is 5'11\" and wears size XL</li>\n</ul><p><br></p><p><b>MATERIALS &amp; CARE</b></p><ul><li>90% Nylon, 10% Elastane</li></ul><p><br></p><p>SKU:\u00a0A5C4B-BB2J</p>",
